<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Kishor Sarma</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff758c, #ff7eb3, #6a5acd);
    overflow: hidden;
}

.card {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 430px;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}

h1 {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    animation: glow 1.5s infinite alternate;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.photo {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 6px solid white;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    margin: 10px auto 20px;
}

.message {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 13px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: white;
    color: #ff4f81;
    font-weight: bold;
}

@keyframes glow {
    from { text-shadow: 0 0 5px white; }
    to { text-shadow: 0 0 25px white, 0 0 40px pink; }
}

.balloon {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 45px;
    animation: float 6s infinite ease-in-out;
}

.b1 { left: 5%; top: 15%; }
.b2 { right: 5%; top: 25%; animation-delay: 1s; }
.b3 { left: 10%; bottom: 10%; animation-delay: 2s; }
.b4 { right: 10%; bottom: 15%; animation-delay: 3s; }

@keyframes float {
    0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-30px); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="balloon b1">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b2">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b3">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b4">🎈</div>

<div class="card">

    <h1>🎉 HAPPY BIRTHDAY 🎉</h1>

    <!-- Replace kishor.jpg with Kishor's photo -->
    <img src="kishor.jpg" class="photo" alt="Kishor Sarma">

    <h2>🎂 Kishor Sarma 🎂</h2>

    <p class="message">
        Wishing you a very Happy Birthday, Kishor! ❤️<br><br>
        May your life always be filled with happiness,
        success, good health and beautiful memories. ✨
        <br><br>
        Have an amazing day and keep smiling always! 🥳🎁
    </p>

    <button onclick="alert('🎂 Happy Birthday Kishor Sarma! 🎉')">
        🎁 Open Birthday Wish
    </button>

</div>

</body>
</html>
